cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this package or its datasets, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "timss-math: Item-level datasets of the released TIMSS mathematics items and LLM predictions of their IRT parameters"
abstract: >-
  Item-level datasets built from every TIMSS released mathematics set
  (1995 to 2011, grades 4 and 8, and TIMSS Advanced), with the official IRT
  item parameters attached, and LLM predictions of the IRT parameters of new
  items grounded in the most similar calibrated items.
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Ze
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/wang-ze/timss-ai"
keywords:
  - TIMSS
  - mathematics assessment
  - item response theory
  - item parameter prediction
  - large language models
  - retrieval-augmented generation
